WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:04,410
Don't open the door again

2
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:06,010
I ordered this thing

3
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:07,410
Let's all play together

4
00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:10,210
Anyway, I've had enough of this stupid life.

5
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:16,780
Kill him?

6
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,770
I haven't lit the fire yet

7
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:22,120
Do you dare to kill?

8
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:26,850
Y'all stay alert here.

9
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:29,450
What am I going to do if I keep an eye on other people?

10
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:31,280
There are many of them

11
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,480
And gasoline

12
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:36,020
do as i say

13
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,220
If there's no control outside

14
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:39,420
Or I send a signal to Ji Feifan

15
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:41,620
You and Li Wei'an are responsible for remote suppression

16
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:43,420
Others guard the doors and windows

17
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:44,820
Prepare for shock

18
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:53,580
Just send a girl out to calf

19
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:54,780
You guys are all dead

20
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:56,780
Let you come out and do the carving

21
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:58,380
You really dare to come out

22
00:00:58,380 --> 00:01:00,780
Are you a little brave?

23
00:01:00,780 --> 00:01:01,780
open the door

24
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:03,780
Let the brothers go in and come up.
